{"availability":"available","full":"Massii-08/tls-fingerprint-scraper-demo","name":"tls-fingerprint-scraper-demo","description":"Demo: 'empty page' results on public sites are often a TLS handshake fingerprint (JA3) check before render — curl_cffi mirrors a real browser's ClientHello to read public data like a normal visitor.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-09T23:04:44Z","updated":"2026-06-09T23:49:42Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["browser-fingerprint","curl-cffi","http-client","ja3","public-data","python","tls-fingerprint","web-scraping"],"demo":"https://www.python.org/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.677Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.677Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.677Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.677Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Empty results behind Cloudflare are often a TLS fingerprint check before the page even renders, not a CAPTCHA.","When you read a public site with a plain Python client and get a blank body, the common assumption is \"CAPTCHA\" or \"I got blocked.\" Frequently the real cause is earlier and quieter: your client was flagged during the TLS handshake by its fingerprint (JA3 / JA4), before any HTML was served. A browser-like TLS handshake (via curlcffi with impersonate=\"chrome\") lets a legitimate client read the same public page a normal visitor sees.","This demo proves the difference safely. It reflects our own TLS fingerprint off a public echo service with two clients and compares the JA3 hashes."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Massii-08/tls-fingerprint-scraper-demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6ccba9686540993b9c4295610063bfd22b6ef81f76f1d604e02d6ca6ac3ad607","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.807Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.807Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Empty results behind Cloudflare are often a TLS fingerprint check before the page even renders, not a CAPTCHA.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Massii-08/tls-fingerprint-scraper-demo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"6ccba9686540993b9c4295610063bfd22b6ef81f76f1d604e02d6ca6ac3ad607","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Massii-08/tls-fingerprint-scraper-demo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.807Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-06-09T23:49:42Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Massii-08/tls-fingerprint-scraper-demo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T06:44:51.808Z","hash":"6ccba9686540993b9c4295610063bfd22b6ef81f76f1d604e02d6ca6ac3ad607","originalBytes":3152,"storedBytes":3152,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["public","tls","client","ja3","fingerprint","normal","cffi","chrome","curl","data","hash","only","python","before","default","echo","handshake","httpx","impersonate","own","page","plain","read","two","visitor","agent","b0efdefa24a7f2b8eb6985bf37","browser-like","browser.","c673fd64a32c8dc1b1e3a8f3a9c1c44","clients","demo","demo.py","differ","distinguish","during","fetch","fingerprints","impersonated","like","live","never","off","private","pytest","reflects","same","scripts","service","site","tlsdemo","user","any","anything","assumption","authenticated","bash","behaves","behind","blank","blocked.","body","browser","captcha","captcha.","cause","check","clienthello","cloudflare","collect","common","compare","compare.py","compares","comparison","data.","deterministic","dev","difference","different","docs","earlier","easy","educational","empty","even","explanation","factual","factual.","feedsmith.","file","fingerprint.py","fingerprinting","flagged","frequently","full","fully","get","got","hashes.","how","html","install","intel","ja4","lazy","legal-safe","legitimate","lets","license","limits","mac","macintosh","matching","mit","mocked","mozilla","network.",